This repository bundles the following supporting skills that originated upstream
under their own MIT licenses (kept in `plugins/platform-sdlc-harness/skills/`):

- `building-native-ui`, `native-data-fetching`, `expo-dev-client`,
  `expo-module`, `upgrading-expo` — Expo (Anthropic-published patterns)
- `brainstorming`, `grill-me`, `grill-with-docs`, `tdd`,
  `requesting-code-review` — Anthropic Superpowers / coding-agent skills

Their inclusion follows the same MIT terms above; original attribution and
content are preserved unchanged in each skill's own files.
